    counterDescription: Stronger at longer range; weak to Ward and Parry.
  - skillName: Rift
    description: A charged rift that ignores Parry and partially pierces Defense.
      Jump avoids it.
    icon: {fileID: -1799386721170512200, guid: ce88f08e40f43234399fd066b415bfc5, type: 3}
    damage: 4
    range: 2-3
    actionSlotCost: 2
    energyCost: 0
    counterDescription: Breaks Ward and Parry; weak to Fade and Jump.
  - skillName: Shift
    description: Move behind the enemy. If that space is invalid, exchange positions.
      Interrupted by Light Attack at close range.
    icon: {fileID: -9095335120657161191, guid: aab57a55df4b5c649b2621ede209ea68, type: 3}
    damage: 0
    range: 1-2
    actionSlotCost: 2
    energyCost: 0
    counterDescription: Repositions to avoid attacks; still vulnerable by range.
  - skillName: Ward
    description: Blocks Light Attack. Heavy Attack breaks through, and Low Attack
      bypasses it.
    icon: {fileID: -6613502331250607294, guid: 92b5bd95768275447acfde610c443055, type: 3}
    damage: 0
    range: 
    actionSlotCost: 1
    energyCost: 0
    counterDescription: Stops fast attacks; weak to guard-break attacks.
  - skillName: Fade
    description: Evades Heavy Attack. Light Attack and Low Attack still hit.
    icon: {fileID: -2627944507539595547, guid: 7dd3b0d9a94f83a41b4469b07712fe38, type: 3}
    damage: 0
    range: 
    actionSlotCost: 1
    energyCost: 0
    counterDescription: Evades committed attacks; weak to fast attacks.
  - skillName: Sight
    description: Once per match. Starting next round, permanently reveal one fixed
      enemy action slot after the enemy is ready.
    icon: {fileID: -6637021777585855951, guid: ad9d96144a022f5479c1fdd918ccd32e, type: 3}
    damage: 0
    range: Full
    actionSlotCost: 1
    energyCost: 5
    counterDescription: Reveals enemy actions; provides no direct defense.
